      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 37,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "By the breath of God, ice is given, and the width of the waters is frozen.",
      "ko": "하나님의 부시는 기운에 얼음이 얼고 물의 넓이가 줄어지느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "947be58a732e5961b3ba56ebc5f6f5f9b75216131ca8b36e869d0ebc5a5d6aac",
      "translation_text_hash": "a704102d33e09956b15854edd5395610c8ab9b32f9f89bc9377de800f8721add",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
