      "en": "It is turned around by his guidance, that they may do whatever he commands them on the surface of the habitable world,",
      "ko": "구름이 인도하시는대로 두루 행하나니 이는 무릇 그의 명하시는 것을 세계상에 이루려 함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "6bf0a94141f4429450d057c1afcb36974d49cb14fe4d7ad7db6121b3b5d76f35",
      "translation_text_hash": "7ebb152c9e4edcdc95b3e8ea3069b104ef024e5d1b7900eccdcafe592b501e71",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
