      "en": "“Listen to this, Job. Stand still, and consider the wondrous works of God.",
      "ko": "욥이여 이것을 듣고 가만히 서서 하나님의 기묘하신 일을 궁구하라",
      "source_text_hash": "cf6e3c3714592309b5103fbee4957c101a987ef6a375929890e9f186b38d78e5",
      "translation_text_hash": "b829f9ab82c33395ec6f72c07619efeb239658cc36c998990ca35665c9fd0010",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
